;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> – Wakil Ketua Bidang UMKM dan Koperasi, APINDO</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3949999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sean Tanbunan</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> – </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Finance &amp; Business Advisor</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, Universitas Ciputra</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3949999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family