style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Sehat dan Alami&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">: Tanpa bahan\r\n     pengawet, hanya bahan herbal berkualitas tinggi.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Rasa Premium&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">: Perpaduan\r\n     kunyit dan asam jawa menghasilkan rasa yang <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:108.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:36.0pt;line-height:normal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">&nbsp; </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">seimbang antara\r\nsegar dan manis.<o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></strong></h3><h3 style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt\">Manfaat Kunyit Asem</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></h3><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Membantu\r\n     membersihkan racun tubuh (detoksifikasi).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Menjaga\r\n     kesehatan pencernaan.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Anti\r\n     inflamasi<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Membantu\r\n     mengurangi nyeri otot ringan.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><h3 style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></strong></h3><h3 style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt\">Cara Penyajian</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></h3><ol style=\"margin-top:0cm\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Masukkan 1\r\n     sachet <strong>Kunyit Asem Weeka</strong> ke dalam cangkir.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Tambahkan\r\n     200-300 ml air panas<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Aduk hingga\r\n     larut dan sajikan.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Untuk\r\n     variasi, tambahkan es batu jika ingin rasa lebih segar!<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ol><h3 style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt\">Untuk Siapa Kunyit Asem Ini?</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></h3><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mereka yang\r\n     mencari minuman sehat untuk menemani aktivitas harian.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Penggemar\r\n     minuman herbal tradisional yang segar dan praktis.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Wisatawan&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>', '[\"public\\/file_foto_produk\\/6796ef29e53c9.jpg\"]', '2025-01-27 09:27:53', '2025-01-27 09:27:53');
