lancarkan pencernaan.<o:p></o:p></span></p><ol style=\"margin-top:0cm\" start=\"4\" type=\"1\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">Jahe&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">:\r\n     Memberikan sensasi hangat, menenangkan tubuh, dan <o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:108.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:36.0pt;line-height:115%\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">&nbsp;\r\n</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">mendukung kesehatan.<o:p></o:p></span></p><div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\ntext-align:center;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n\r\n<hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n</span></div><h4 style=\"margin-top:0cm;line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><b><u>Keunggulan Produk</u></b></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></h4><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\"><b>Alami dan Kaya Manfaat</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Diproses\r\ntanpa pewarna dan pengawet buatan, hanya dari bahan-bahan alami berkualitas.<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">Transformasi Warna yang Unik</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Warna\r\nbiru dari bunga telang berubah menjadi ungu cerah saat dicampur dengan lemon,\r\nmemberikan pengalaman visual yang menyenangkan.<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">Rasa dan Aroma yang Kaya</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Kombinasi\r\nrasa asam-manis lemon, kehangatan jahe, dan kesegaran serai menciptakan harmoni\r\nsempurna.<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">Mudah Disajikan</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Praktis\r\nuntuk diseduh, cocok untuk suasana santai atau sebagai pendamping aktivitas\r\nharian.<o:p></o:p></span></p><div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\ntext-align:center;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n\r\n<hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n</span></div><h4 style=\"margin-top:0cm;line-height:115%\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">Manfaat Bunga Telang +\r\nLemon dengan Serai dan Jahe</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></h4><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">Antioksidan Tinggi</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Melindungi\r\ntubuh dari radikal bebas dan membantu regenerasi sel.<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">Meningkatkan Daya Tahan Tubuh</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Kombinasi\r\nvitamin C dari lemon dan zat aktif dari jahe mendukung imunitas tubuh.<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">Menenangkan dan Menyegarkan</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Aroma\r\nserai dan jahe membantu relaksasi, sekaligus memberikan energi baru.<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%\">Melancarkan Pencernaan</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Kandungan\r\njahe dan serai membantu meredakan gangguan pencernaan ringan.<o:p></o:p></span></p><div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\ntext-align:center;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n\r\n<hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n</span></div><h4 style=\"margin-top:0cm;line-height:115%\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">Cara Penyajian</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></h4><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><ol style=\"margin-top:0cm\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Seduh\r\n     <strong>1 sachet Bunga Telang Weeka</strong> dengan <strong>250-300 ml air\r\n     panas</strong> hingga warna biru alami keluar sempurna.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Tambahkan\r\n     perasan lemon segar sesuai selera.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Aduk\r\n     perlahan, nikmati warna ungu cerah yang terbentuk.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\n     115%;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Tambahkan\r\n     gula sesuai selera untuk rasa manis yang pas, dan sajikan hangat atau\r\n     tambahkan es untuk sensasi dingin.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ol>', '[\"public\\/file_foto_produk\\/6796eff73046e.jpg\"]', '2025-01-27 09:31:19', '2025-01-27 09:31:19');
