 font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.15pt; font-family: Helvetica;\">Menghubungkan koperasi dengan para pihak baik dalam rangka membangun kolaborasi</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.15pt;\">Output Pendampingan</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"OYPEnA text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 0px; text-size-adjust: auto; font-family: Helvetica;\">1. Rencana Bisnis</span><span class=\"OYPEnA text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none white-space-prewrap\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans&quot;, sans-serif; text-indent: 0px; text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica;\"> </span></span><span class=\"OYPEnA text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 0px; text-size-adjust: auto; font-family: Helvetica;\">meliputi Manajemen, Produk, Pasar, Strategi, Rencana Program,</span><span class=\"OYPEnA text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none white-space-prewrap\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans&quot;, sans-serif; text-indent: 0px; text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica;\"> </span></span><span class=\"OYPEnA text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 0px; text-size-adjust: auto; font-family: Helvetica;\">Keuangan, Proyeksi &amp; Lampiran pendukung</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"OYPEnA text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 0px; text-size-adjust: auto; font-family: Helvetica;\">2. Pitch Deck :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.15pt; font-family: Helvetica; letter-spacing: 0.004em; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.15pt; font-family: Helvetica; letter-spacing: 0.004em; font-size: 14px;\">Garam Mon Kuta dan&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.15pt; font-family: Helvetica; letter-spacing: 0.004em; font-size: 14px;\">SPBUN&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -14.15pt; font-family: Helvetica; letter-spacing: 0.004em; font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><b style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.15pt; font-family: Helvetica;\">Tindak Lanjut dan Saran</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">Koperasi perlu melakukan rektrukturisasi anggota koperasi ; Konsumen Biosolar yakni nelayan secara otomatis harus menjadi anggota koperasi</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">Akses Pendanaan Para Pihak baik individu, LPDB atau Perbankan</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">Pendampingan pelaksanaan Pengembangan unit usaha Koperas</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">Pendampingan Digitalisasi Koperasi ; Manajemen Keuangan, E-Commerce, Website, Media Sosial</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">Peningkatan Kapasitas Anggota Koperasi Baru dan Lama</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">6.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">Melakukan Analisa Pasar secara berkala</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">7.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">Pendidikan yang tematik dan reguler</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">8.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\">Advokasi Aturan Rekomendasi dari Dinas Terkait agar tengat waktu bisa lebih lama durasinya</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><b style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 10.75pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica;\">Rekomendasi</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 10.75pt;\">Koperasi Tunas Usaha Sejahtera memiliki potensi yang sangat luar biasa pada&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12pt;\">Sektor Perikanan, Kelautan dan Kehutanan. Mereka memiliki</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><i style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12pt;\">legal standing, </i><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12pt;\">sertifikasi dan izin lahan seluas 1.702 Hektar Kawasan Hutan Rakyat. Mereka sangat membutuhkan akses pembiayaan modal</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 38px; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12pt;\">kerja dengan berbagai skema untuk melakukan pengembangan unit usaha lainnya pada Koperasi Ini.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 3cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; text-indent: -14.15pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2023-06-07', '2023-10-07', '2023-10-16 15:06:49', '2023-12-03 00:11:13');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2434, 447, 'public/foto_profil_tenant/652e32490459d.jpg', 'Marikost', 'Samuel Sianturi, Ayu Tantyana, Gerry Geraldi, Amelia Dianti', 44, 5, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, 'Website : www.marikost.com, Instagram : @marikostapp', NULL, NULL, '<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Aplikasi\r\npengelolaan dan pencarian hunian sementara (kost) dengan berbagai fitur seperti\r\nfilterisasi pencarian kost, review, fitur layanan jasa, hingga kelola kost.&nbsp;</span><br></p>', '2022-02-01', '2024-02-17', '2023-10-17 14:04:53', '2023-10-17 15:28:59');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2435, 447, NULL, 'UDAWA Smart System', 'Muhammad Zafran Zulkifli dan Prodi TI', 44, 2, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, 'https://narin.co.id/artikel/platform-udawa-universal-digital-agriculture-watering-assistant.htm', NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\nmso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Platform pertanian presisi untuk petani kecil\r\nyang mengusung konsep peasant centric dengan memanfaatkan teknologi informasi\r\nuntuk mengefisienkan dan mengoptimalkan proses bertani.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-17 14:07:35', '2023-10-17 14:07:35');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2436, 447, 'public/foto_profil_tenant/652e330b66e54.jpeg', 'Kopi Mile', 'I Wayan Kurniawan Sadukari', NULL, NULL, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, 'Instagram : @milenials.eskopi', NULL, NULL, '<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nCalibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Mile\r\nCoffee merupakan coffee shop yang menyediakan inovasi produk minuman kopi\r\nberkualitas dan aneka makanan ringan dengan harga yang terjangkau</span><br></p>', '2019-08-17', '2021-08-17', '2023-10-17 14:08:59', '2023-10-17 15:26:05');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2437, 447, 'public/foto_profil_tenant/652e342378e78.jpg', 'Etclas.Apparel', 'Desi Mayoni, Ni Kadek Nofianti', 19, 1, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, 'Instagram : @etclas.Apparel', NULL, NULL, '<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Usaha\r\nyang bergerak dibidang fashion design dengan menerapkan AR di beberapa Design\r\nyang ada, serta&nbsp; melayani design custome dari custumer.</span><br></p>', '2022-05-28', '2024-02-17', '2023-10-17 14:13:39', '2023-10-17 15:30:20');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2438, 447, NULL, 'Manik By Gewe', 'Anak Agung Sagung Wulan Nirmala Devi', 26, 1, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, 'Instagram : @manikbygewe', NULL, NULL, '<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Manik\r\nby Gewe menjual accessories berupa cincin, gelang, kalung, dan strap phone\r\ndengan bahan dasar manik-manik</span><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-17 14:18:18', '2023-10-17 14:18:18');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2439, 447, NULL, 'Jelita Cake’s', 'Ni Putu Jelita Permata Putri', 23, 2, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, 'Instagram : @jelita.cakes', NULL, NULL, '<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Jelita\r\nCace’s merupakan UMKM yang menjual berbagai macam kue/bolu yang memiliki\r\nberbagai macam varian</span><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-17 14:20:17', '2023-10-17 14:20:17');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2440, 447, NULL, 'Brothershoescare', 'I Putu Abdi Putra Budiartha', 20, 1, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, 'Instagram : @brothershoescare', NULL, NULL, '<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Brothershoescare\r\nmerupakan usaha yang bergerak dibidang laundry sepatu dengan banyak varian\r\ntreatment didalamnya seperti contoh : deep cleaning treatment, repaint\r\ntreatment, recolor treatment, sol dan reglue.</span><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-17 14:21:13', '2023-10-17 14:21:13');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2441, 447, 'public/foto_profil_tenant/652e4989908e4.jpg', 'AKORDMUSIC', 'Anak Agung Bagus Surya Dharma Kumara, De Guda Kessa, Marcella Karent', 44, 5, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, 'Instagram : @akordmusic  Website : https://akordmusic.com/', NULL, NULL, '<p>Akordmusic&nbsp; merupakan&nbsp; platform&nbsp; berbasis&nbsp; pelayanan&nbsp; jasa&nbsp; yang&nbsp; dapat&nbsp; memberikan kemudahan&nbsp; kepada&nbsp; penyelenggara&nbsp; event&nbsp; terhadap&nbsp; talent&nbsp; dalam&nbsp; melakukan&nbsp; reservasi&nbsp; atas kebutuhan live music. Plaftform ini akan dilengkapi oleh berbagai fitur seperti fitur booking, promo,&nbsp; membership,&nbsp; filter,&nbsp; rekomendasi,&nbsp; live,&nbsp; about&nbsp; Akordmusic.&nbsp; Pada&nbsp; fitur&nbsp; booking, pengguna&nbsp; dapat&nbsp; melakukan&nbsp; reservasi&nbsp; dengan&nbsp; menentukan&nbsp; jadwal,&nbsp; harga,&nbsp; lokasi,&nbsp; format&nbsp; dan genre&nbsp; yang&nbsp; sesuai&nbsp; keinginan&nbsp; penyelenggara&nbsp; event.&nbsp; Dalam&nbsp; fitur&nbsp; ini,&nbsp; pengguna&nbsp; website&nbsp; dapat melihat&nbsp; portofolio&nbsp; kerja&nbsp; dari&nbsp; talent&nbsp; yang&nbsp; ada&nbsp; di&nbsp; dalam&nbsp; website&nbsp; tersebut.&nbsp; Portofolio&nbsp; talent&nbsp; ini akan berupa video ataupun foto pada saat talent manggung sebelumnya.&nbsp;<br></p>', '2022-05-28', '2024-02-17', '2023-10-17 15:44:57', '2023-10-17 15:44:57');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2442, 447, 'public/foto_profil_tenant/652e4ae2c0c2d.jpg', 'SEGARA', 'Putri Adnyani, Anggi', 19, 1, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, 'Instagram : @segara.essentials  Website :  https://www.segaraessentials.com/', NULL, NULL, '<p>Menyediakan pakaian yang tersedia untuk pria dan wanita dalam desain eksklusif, terbuat dari bahan berkualitas tinggi, dan membawa mode berkelanjutan. Pakaian yang harus dimiliki untuk melengkapi standar gaya hidup Anda. Kesederhanaan dalam kehidupan tropis.<br></p>', '2022-05-28', '2024-02-17', '2023-10-17 15:50:42', '2023-10-17 15:50:42');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2443, 447, 'public/foto_profil_tenant/652e4b3d3636b.jpeg', 'CATTLEYA', 'Wahyu Cahyani, Tapayasa', 19, 1, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Fashion&nbsp; menjadi&nbsp; salah&nbsp; satu&nbsp; jawaban&nbsp; bagi manusia&nbsp; untuk&nbsp; merefleksikan&nbsp; kepribadian&nbsp; mereka. “You are what You wear” yang artinya manusia dilihat dan&nbsp; dinilai&nbsp; pertama&nbsp; kali&nbsp; oleh&nbsp; orang&nbsp; lain&nbsp; dari&nbsp; segi visual&nbsp; termasuk&nbsp; cara&nbsp; berpenampilan&nbsp; seseorang. Cattleya&nbsp; adalah&nbsp; usaha&nbsp; yang&nbsp; ikut&nbsp; berpartisipasi&nbsp; dalam menjawab&nbsp; kebutuhan&nbsp; konsumen&nbsp; di&nbsp; bidang&nbsp; fashion dengan fokus luaran produk totebag. Usaha ini resmi dijalankan dari juni 2021 dengan produk pertamanya totebag jenis kain katun dengan desain kotak one set (totebag,&nbsp; scrunchies,&nbsp; dan&nbsp; masker)&nbsp; hingga kini banyak model-model&nbsp; yang&nbsp; telah&nbsp; dikeluarkan&nbsp; seperti&nbsp; portrait, circle,&nbsp; dan&nbsp; landscape&nbsp; dengan&nbsp; perpaduan&nbsp; berbagai warna, bahan (kanvas dan goni) yang ditawarkan.<br></p>', '2022-05-28', '2024-02-17', '2023-10-17 15:52:13', '2023-10-17 15:52:13');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2444, 447, 'public/foto_profil_tenant/652e4bdf1ece8.jpeg', 'PESAWAH COFFEE', 'Ayu Candra,Dinda', 23, 2, 'Jl. Bedugul No.39, Sidakarya, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80224', NULL, NULL, 'Instagram : @pesawahcoffee   Website : https://pesawahcoffee.com/', NULL, NULL, '<p>Pesawah Coffee berlokasi di Jalan Raya Rijasa, Desa Rejasa, Kecamatan Penebel, Kabupaten Tabanan. Pesawah Coffee resmi dibuka( Grand Opening ) pada tanggal 15 April 2022. Pesawah Coffee buka setiap hari mulai pukul 10. 00 Wita – 21.00 Wita. Coffee shop ini menyediakan menu mulai dari Main Course, Coffee,Non Coffee dan Dessert.</p><p>Dalam pengembangan bisnisnya, untuk menarik minat pembeli kami melakukan pemasaran secara Digital Marketing melalui akun Sosial media “Pesawah Coffee”. Selain itu, kami juga mempergunakan website dalam memasarkan dan memperkenalkan produk kami agar bisa di jangkau oleh masyarakat luas, demi mendukung kelancaran usaha kami dalam dunia Digitalisasi saat ini.</p>', '2022-05-28', '2024-02-17', '2023-10-17 15:54:55', '2023-10-17 15:54:55');
INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (2445, 456, 'public/foto_profil_tenant/653c74113a219.jpeg', 'RUMAH JAMUR', 'DARWATI', 1, 2, 'Jln Prambanan Tawun 1 Tawun Kasreman', NULL, '14.500.000,00', 'dor to dor', 'kacamatan', 'manual', '<p>jamur adlah kebutuhan yang sangat di cari2 saat ini,<br></p>', '2023-01-09', '2025-06-08', '2023-10-23 07:58:50', '2024-05-14 09:43:09');
