mic Sans MS&quot;;\">maupun mie rebus sehingga dapat </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">disesuaikan </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">dengan keinginan konsumen</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">. </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">Kemasan&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">Misebi </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">dilengkapi </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">dengan </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">desain </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">yang mencantumkan saran penyajian yang inovatif</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">Sehingga konsumen dapat mengolah </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">berbagai </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">macam varian mie dengan versi </span></font><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"\">sehat.</font></span> </span></p>', '2023-06-01', '2023-12-31', '2023-12-14 10:55:15', '2023-12-14 10:55:15');
