INSERT INTO `tenant` VALUES (4760, 336, NULL, 'Keripik Tronggong', 'Fitri Nur Jannah', 40, 7, 'Jatibarang, Brebes', NULL, '10.000.000,00', 'Facebook', 'Lokal', 'Belum ada', '<div class=\"message-box-content-wrapper-nDROih\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); align-items: center; display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content; overflow: visible; position: relative; width: 459px; overflow-anchor: auto;\"><div class=\"message-content message-box-content-lcvP3O receive-message-box-content-Ak2lgP samantha-message-box-content-h0ZP5s\" data-testid=\"message_content\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: var(--color-neutral-100,#000); font-size: var(--font-size-large,16px); line-height: var(--msg-line-height,24px); max-width: var(--chat-area-max-width); width: 459px; min-width: 0px; overflow: visible; word-break: break-word; overflow-anchor: auto;\"><div data-testid=\"message_text_content\" theme-mode=\"light\" class=\"container-p2nY4f flow-markdown-body theme-samantha-D0_4Ug\" dir=\"ltr\" data-show-indicator=\"false\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); --md-box-samantha-normal-text-color: var(--s-color-text-secondary); --md-box-samantha-deep-text-color: var(--s-color-text-primary); --md-box-samantha-li-maker-color: var(--s-color-text-tertiary); --md-box-samantha-split-line-color: var(--s-color-border-primary); --md-box-samantha-blockquote-left-border-color: var(--s-color-text-quaternary); color: var(--color-text-primary); color-scheme: light; overflow: visible; text-size-adjust: 100%; overflow-anchor: auto; --md-box-paragraph-spacing: 8px !important;\"><div class=\"auto-hide-last-sibling-br paragraph-u1TS5p paragraph-element br-paragraph-space\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); line-height: var(--md-box-samantha-normal-text-line-height); overflow-anchor: auto; font-size: var(--md-box-samantha-normal-text-font-size); color: var(--md-box-samantha-normal-text-color) !important;\">Sebagai seorang pengusaha di Jatibarang, Brebes, saya menjalankan usaha perdagangan eceran dengan fokus pada produk keripik tronggong, camilan unik dan khas yang terbuat dari kembang turi. Keripik tronggong memiliki cita rasa yang khas dan unik, yang meyakinkan saya akan potensi pasar yang menjanjikan.</div><br class=\"container-PzX343 wrapper-NZ1vL1 undefined\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); content: &quot;&quot;; display: block; font-size: var(--md-box-paragraph-spacing); margin: 1em; overflow-anchor: auto;\"><div class=\"auto-hide-last-sibling-br paragraph-u1TS5p paragraph-element br-paragraph-space\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); line-height: var(--md-box-samantha-normal-text-line-height); overflow-anchor: auto; font-size: var(--md-box-samantha-normal-text-font-size); color: var(--md-box-samantha-normal-text-color) !important;\">Saya percaya bahwa keripik tronggong, dengan keunikannya yang khas, memiliki potensi untuk menjadi produk yang diminati di Jatibarang dan sekitarnya. Dengan semangat dan dedikasi yang tinggi, saya siap untuk mengembangkan usaha ini dan memperkenalkan keripik tronggong kepada khalayak yang lebih luas.</div><div><br></div></div></div></div><div class=\"answer-action-bar-MECk3C bottom-action-bar-wrapper-EmBxFl large-space-VAvLxB answer-action-bar\" data-testid=\"message_action_bar\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: calc(var(--answer-action-small-size, 16px) + var(--answer-action-bar-vertical-spacing, 12px)); overflow: hidden; width: 459px; --answer-action-bar-vertical-spacing: 24px; overflow-anchor: auto;\"><div class=\"container-x3q9t6 container-WoBT2A bottom-action-bar-t2Ap99\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin-top: var(--answer-action-bar-vertical-spacing,12px); display: flex; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content; justify-content: space-between; min-height: var(--answer-action-small-size); align-items: flex-start; align-self: center; width: 459px; overflow-anchor: auto;\"><div class=\"left-Jj7zwC\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); display: flex; flex: 1 1 0%; flex-direction: row; height: fit-content; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; justify-content: flex-start; overflow-anchor: auto;\"><div class=\"bp5-overflow-list container-uvaRiZ align-start-A9MbD9 inner-rETKn9\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); align-items: center; width: 459px; display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; min-width: 0px; justify-content: flex-start; overflow-anchor: auto;\"><button data-testid=\"message_action_copy\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"semi-button semi-button-primary semi-button-light container-itdVBm size-small-jRkGfO background-white-UHLQ9t color-grey-deep-jkGkzB semi-button-with-icon semi-button-with-icon-only\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"x8odjt9\" data-popupid=\"x8odjt9\" style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); align-items: center; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: transparent; box-shadow: none; display: inline-flex; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; height: var(--s-radius-xl,24px); justify-content: center; line-height: 20px; outline: none; padding: 8px; user-select: none; vertical-align: middle; text-wrap: nowrap; transform: scale(var(--semi-transform_scale-n